        },
        {
          "text": "USolomoni wayelezibaya zamabhiza lezezinqola zokulwa ezizinkulungwane ezine, lamabhiza empi azinkulungwane ezilitshumi lambili; amanye wawabeka emizini yezinqola, lamanye enkosini eJerusalema.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.25",
