        {
          "text": "Ezinye izenzo zikaSolomoni, kusukela ekuqaleni kuze kube sekucineni, zilotshiwe ezindabeni zomlando kaNathani umprofethi, lakusiprofethi sikaAhija waseShiloni, lasemibonweni kaIdo umboni emayelana loJerobowamu indodana kaNebati.",
