              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waya kwabaphansi, wangcwatshelwa emzini kaDavida uyise. URehobowamu indodana yakhe waba yinkosi esikhundleni sakhe.",
          "type": "text",
